  "ruleText": "He-P 2302.01 License Required. Unless exempted under RSA 143-A:5, RSA 143-A:5-a, or He-P 2302.02, no person shall operate a food establishment in New Hampshire without obtaining a license from the department.\n\nSource. #2802, eff 8-8-84-EXPIRED 8-8-90\n\nNew. #6503, INTERIM, eff 4-25-97; EXPIRED 8-23-97\n\nNew. #6722, eff 3-27-98; ss by #7893, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9857-A, eff 2-1-11, EXPIRED: 2-1-19\n\nNew. #12729, INTERIM, eff 2-21-19, EXPIRES: 8-20-19; ss by #12852, eff 8-20-19",
